          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Boss战具有挑战且战胜后的回报感强。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "source": "鉴赏家观点",
      "polarity": "喜欢",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "RELOADIAN boss fights are challenging but very rewarding to overcome finally.",
